:"harness:codex","text":"{\"text\": \"Project adoption 2026-09-28: add six zero-debt active-readiness assertions to the existing tracker-context-quality gate for description, acceptance criteria, risk, confidence, estimate and expected result. This catches the observed newly filed Sentry migration omission locally and in hosted CI using the same native SDK assurance engine. Historical terminal fields remain outside this active-only gate and retain their known evidence-recovery owners. Prove the gate with a temporary missing-field item and the same item after repair, without changing production data for a negative control.\"}"}]}],"before_hash":"aac50c1fa5e9dfd2a15d328cefc4c1f53b280c541f0a8740d1fa8e07ea98f82d","after_hash":"8ef6e84465ae6cb341e4d11a64258496faaef68f68e73b430dfdabdc54963e0f","item_hash_version":3,"message":"Evidence-grounded ecosystem planning review 2026-09-28","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"c99587db4eaf533b16c07661f8c8434428bdc2e9005e8926054ed61f37dd6010"}
